tion iv) Non-repudiation", ""], "opts": [["i, ii and iii only", ""], ["ii, iii and iv only", ""], ["i, iii and iv only", ""], ["All i, ii, iii and iv 2 ................ is to protect data and passwords", ""]], "ans": 2, "exp": ["Nukta: ⚠ CAUTION — answer NOT verified: compiled-bank source key = (C). Please verify before relying.", "⚠ सावधान — उत्तर verify नहीं है: source key = (C)। कृपया उपयोग से पहले स्वयं जाँच कर लें।"], "src": "Repo: networkmcq — GDC Ramban solved MCQ (new/ 2026 drop)", "sec": "Section C — Firewalls, IPSec & Security Protocols", "diff": "hard", "stype": "repository_internal", "style": "concept", "tags": ["GATE CS", "UGC-NET 087", "RPSC Programmer", "RPSC ACP/DD"]}, {"q": ["The following protocols and system are commonly used to provide various degrees of security services in computer network. i) IP filtering ii) Reverse Address Translation iii) IP security Architecture (IPsec) iv) Firewalls v) Socks", ""], "opts": [["i, ii, iii and iv only", ""], ["i, iii, iv and v only", ""], ["ii, iii, iv and v only", ""], ["All i, ii, iii, iv and v", ""]], "ans": 0, "exp": ["Nukta: ⚠ CAUTION — answer NOT verified: compiled-bank source key = (A). Please verify before relying.", "⚠ सावधान — उत्तर verify नहीं है: source key = (A)। कृपया उपयोग से पहले स्वयं जाँच कर लें।"], "src": "Repo: networkmcq — GDC Ramban solved MCQ (new/ 2026 drop)", "sec": "Section C — Firewalls, IPSec & Security Protocols", "diff": "hard", "stype": "repository_internal", "style": "concept", "tags": ["GATE CS", "UGC-NET 087", "RPSC Programmer", "RPSC ACP/DD"]}, {"q": ["A firewall is installed at the point where the secure internal network and untrusted external network meet which is also known as ………………", ""], "opts": [["Chock point", ""], ["meeting point", ""], ["firewall point", ""], ["secure point", ""]], "ans": 0, "exp": ["Nukta: ⚠ CAUTION — answer NOT verified: compiled-bank source key = (A). Please verify before relying.", "⚠ सावधान — उत्तर verify नहीं है: source key = (A)। कृपया उपयोग से पहले स्वयं जाँच कर लें।"], "src": "Repo: networkmcq — GDC Ramban solved MCQ (new/ 2026 drop)", "sec": "Section C — Firewalls, IPSec & Security Protocols", "diff": "medium", "stype": "repository_internal", "style": "concept", "tags": ["RSMSSB Informatics Assistant", "SSC Computer Awareness", "RPSC Programmer"]}, {"q": ["The components of IP security includes …………………", ""], "opts": [["Authentication Header (AH)", ""], ["Encapsulating Security Payload (ESP)", ""], ["Internet key Exchange (IKE)", ""], ["All of the above 7 ....................... is used to carry traffic of one protocol over network that does not support that protocol directly", ""]], "ans": 2, "exp": ["Nukta: ⚠ CAUTION — answer NOT verified: compiled-bank source key = (C). Please verify before relying.", "⚠ सावधान — उत्तर verify नहीं है: source key = (C)। कृपया उपयोग से पहले स्वयं जाँच कर लें।"], "src": "Repo: networkmcq — GDC Ramban solved MCQ (new/ 2026 drop)", "sec": "Section C — Firewalls, IPSec & Security Protocols", "diff": "hard", "stype": "repository_internal", "style": "concept", "tags": ["GATE CS", "UGC-NET 087", "RPSC Programmer", "RPSC ACP/DD"]}, {"q": ["The ................is used to provide integrity check, authentication and encryption to IP datagram", ""], "opts": [["SSL", ""], ["ESP", ""], ["TSL", ""], ["PSL", ""]], "ans": 1, "exp": ["Nukta: ⚠ CAUTION — answer NOT verified: compiled-bank source key = (B). Please verify before relying.", "⚠ सावधान — उत्तर verify नहीं है: source key = (B)। कृपया उपयोग से पहले स्वयं जाँच कर लें।"], "src": "Repo: networkmcq — GDC Ramban solved MCQ (new/ 2026 drop)", "sec": "Section C — Firewalls, IPSec & Security Protocols", "diff": "medium", "stype": "repository_internal", "style": "concept", "tags": ["RSMSSB Informatics Assistant", "SSC Computer Awareness", "RPSC Programmer"]}, {"q": ["The ............................. Is a collection of protocols designed by Internet Engineering Task Force(IETF) to provide security for a packet at the Network level", ""], "opts": [["IPsec", ""], ["Netsec", ""], ["Packetsec", ""], ["Protocolsec", ""]], "ans": 0, "exp": ["Nukta: ⚠ CAUTION — answer NOT verified: compiled-bank source key = (A). Please verify before relying.", "⚠ सावधान — उत्तर verify नहीं है: source key = (A)। कृपया उपयोग से पहले स्वयं जाँच कर लें।"], "src": "Repo: networkmcq — GDC Ramban solved MCQ (new/ 2026 drop)", "sec": "Section C — Firewalls, IPSec & Security Protocols", "diff": "medium", "stype": "repository_internal", "style": "concept", "tags": ["RSMSSB Informatics Assistant", "SSC Computer Awareness", "RPSC Programmer"]}, {"q": ["At the lower layer of SSL, a protocol for transferring data using a variety of predefined cipher and authentication combinations called the ………………", ""], "opts": [["SSL handshake protocol", ""], ["SSL authentication protocol", ""], ["SSL record protocol", ""], ["SSL cipher protocol", ""]], "ans": 3, "exp": ["Nukta: ⚠ CAUTION — answer NOT verified: compiled-bank source key = (D). Please verify before relying.", "⚠ सावधान — उत्तर verify नहीं है: source key = (D)। कृपया उपयोग से पहले स्वयं जाँच कर लें।"], "src": "Repo: networkmcq — GDC Ramban solved MCQ (new/ 2026 drop)", "sec": "Section C — Firewalls, IPSec & Security Protocols", "diff": "medium", "stype": "repository_internal", "style": "concept", "tags": ["RSMSSB Informatics Assistant", "SSC Computer Awareness", "RPSC Programmer"]}, {"q": ["On the upper layer of SSL, a protocol for initial authentication and transfer of encryption keys, called the …………………", ""], "opts": [["SSL handshake protocol", ""], ["SSL authentication protocol", ""], ["SSL record protocol GOVT.DEGREE COLLEGE RAMBAN(J&K) DEPARTMENT OF COMPUTER APPLICATION Solved Multiple Choice Questions on Computer networking", ""], ["SSL cipher protocol", ""]], "ans": 0, "exp": ["Nukta: ⚠ CAUTION — answer NOT verified: compiled-bank source key = (A). Please verify before relying.", "⚠ सावधान — उत्तर verify नहीं है: source key = (A)। कृपया उपयोग से पहले स्वयं जाँच कर लें।"], "src": "Repo: networkmcq — GDC Ramban solved MCQ (new/ 2026 drop)", "sec": "Section C — Firewalls, IPSec & Security Protocols", "diff": "medium", "stype": "repository_internal", "style": "concept", "tags": ["RSMSSB Informatics Assistant", "SSC Computer Awareness", "RPSC Programmer"]}, {"q": ["In packet-filtering router, the following information can be external from the packet header. i) Source IP address ii) Destination IP address iii) TCP/UDP source port iv) ICMP message type v) TCP/UDP destination port", ""], "opts": [["i, ii, iii and iv only", ""], ["i, iii, iv and v only", ""], ["ii, iii, iv and v only", ""], ["All i, ii, iii, iv and v 10 .................. mode is used whenever either end of a security association is gateway", ""]], "ans": 1, "exp": ["Nukta: ⚠ CAUTION — answer NOT verified: compiled-bank source key = (B). Please verify before relying.", "⚠ सावधान — उत्तर verify नहीं है: source key = (B)। कृपया उपयोग से पहले स्वयं जाँच कर लें।"], "src": "Repo: networkmcq — GDC Ramban solved MCQ (new/ 2026 drop)", "sec": "Section C — Firewalls, IPSec & Security Protocols", "diff": "hard", "stype": "repository_internal", "style": "concept", "tags": ["GATE CS", "UGC-NET 087", "RPSC Programmer", "RPSC ACP/DD"]}];
const L = ["A","B","C","D"];
let S = { qs: [], idx: 0, mode: "quiz", name: "", t0: 0, endAt: 0, tick: null,
        pending: undefined, answers: {}, marks: {}, visited: {}, spent: [],
        enter: 0, lang: "both", palHidden: false };

function shuffle(a) { for (let i=a.length-1;i>0;i--) { const j=Math.floor(Math.random()*(i+1)); const t=a[i]; a[i]=a[j]; a[j]=t; } return a; }
function esc(s) { const d=document.createElement('div'); d.textContent = s==null?'':String(s); return d.innerHTML; }
function fmt(sec) { sec=Math.max(0,sec); const m=Math.floor(sec/60), s=sec%60; return (m<10?'0':'')+m+':'+(s<10?'0':'')+s; }

/* ---------- start ---------- */
function startTest() {
  const name = document.getElementById('nameIn').value.trim();
  if (!name) { alert('Kripya apna naam likhein.'); return; }
  if (!document.getElementById('agreeIn').checked) { alert('Kripya instructions padhkar checkbox tik karein.'); return; }
  S.name = name;
  S.mode = document.getElementById('modeIn').value;
  /* --- exam / difficulty / source / type filters (audited tags) --- */
  const examSel = document.getElementById('examIn') ? document.getElementById('examIn').value : 'all';
  const diffSel = document.getElementById('diffIn') ? document.getElementById('diffIn').value : 'all';
  const srcSel = document.getElementById('srcIn') ? document.getElementById('srcIn').value : 'all';
  const typeSel = document.getElementById('typeIn') ? document.getElementById('typeIn').value : 'all';
  const langSel = document.getElementById('langIn') ? document.getElementById('langIn').value : 'both';
  S.lang = langSel;
  let pool = QUESTIONS.filter(q => {
    if (diffSel !== 'all' && q.diff !== diffSel) return false;
    if (srcSel !== 'all' && q.stype !== srcSel) return false;
    if (typeSel !== 'all' && q.style !== typeSel) return false;
    if (examSel !== 'all' && !(q.tags || []).some(t => t.indexOf(examSel) !== -1)) return false;
    return true;
  });
  if (!pool.length) { alert('In filters ke liye koi question nahi mila — filters badalkar dobara try karein.'); return; }
  /* --- mock marking preset (labelled mock; NOT an official scheme) --- */
  const mk = document.getElementById('markIn') ? document.getElementById('markIn').value : '1:0';
  const parts = mk.split(':');
  S.marking = { pos: parseFloat(parts[0]), neg: parseFloat(parts[1]) };
  S.markLabel = parts[2] || 'mock';
  let count = parseInt(document.getElementById('countIn').value, 10) || pool.length;
  count = Math.min(count, pool.length);
  const tpq = parseInt(document.getElementById('tpqIn').value, 10) || 60;
  S.qs = shuffle(pool.slice()).slice(0, count).map(q => {
    const ix = [0,1,2,3]; shuffle(ix);
    return { q: q.q, opts: ix.map(i => q.opts[i]), ans: ix.indexOf(q.ans), exp: q.exp, src: q.src, sec: q.sec };
  });
  S.idx = 0; S.pending = undefined; S.answers = {}; S.marks = {}; S.visited = {};
  S.spent = new Array(S.qs.length).fill(0);
  S.t0 = Date.now();
  S.endAt = S.mode === 'exam' ? S.t0 + count * tpq * 1000 : 0;
  document.getElementById('startCard').style.display = 'none';
  document.getElementById('resultCard').style.display = 'none';
  document.getElementById('examRoot').style.display = '';
  document.getElementById('whoLine').innerHTML = '<b>' + esc(S.name) + '</b> &nbsp;|&nbsp; ' + (S.mode==='quiz'?'Quiz Mode':'Exam Mode');
  clearInterval(S.tick);
  S.tick = setInterval(tickTimer, 500);
  tickTimer();
  renderPalette(); renderQ();
}
function tickTimer() {
  const el = document.getElementById('timerLine');
  if (S.mode === 'exam') {
    const left = Math.round((S.endAt - Date.now())/1000);
    el.textContent = fmt(left);
    el.className = 'val' + (left <= 60 ? ' low' : '');
    if (left <= 0) { clearInterval(S.tick); submitTest(true); }
  } else {
    el.textContent = fmt(Math.floor((Date.now()-S.t0)/1000));
    el.className = 'val';
  }
}

/* ---------- language / zoom / palette toggle / fullscreen ---------- */
function setLang(v) {
  S.lang = v;
  document.getElementById('langE').classList.toggle('on', v==='en');
  document.getElementById('langH').classList.toggle('on', v==='hi');
  document.getElementById('langB').classList.toggle('on', v==='both');
  document.getElementById('langBtn').textContent = v==='en'?'Language: English':(v==='hi'?'Language: Hindi':'Language: Both');
  renderQ();
}
function toggleLang() {
  S.lang = S.lang === 'both' ? 'en' : (S.lang === 'en' ? 'hi' : 'both');
  document.getElementById('langBtn').textContent =
    S.lang === 'en' ? 'Language: English' : (S.lang === 'hi' ? 'Language: Hindi' : 'Language: Both');
  renderQ();
}
function zoom(d) {
  const b = document.body;
  let z = parseFloat(b.style.fontSize || '15');
  z = Math.min(22, Math.max(12, z + d));
  b.style.fontSize = z + 'px';
}
function togglePalette() {
  S.palHidden = !S.palHidden;
  document.getElementById('palettePanel').classList.toggle('hidden', S.palHidden);
  document.getElementById('palToggle').textContent = S.palHidden ? '«' : '»';
  document.getElementById('palToggle').title = S.palHidden ? 'Palette dikhayein' : 'Palette chhupayein';
}
function toggleFull() {
  if (!document.fullscreenElement) document.documentElement.requestFullscreen && document.documentElement.requestFullscreen();
  else document.exitFullscreen && document.exitFullscreen();
}

/* ---------- palette ---------- */
function paletteClass(i) {
  if (S.marks[i]) return (S.answers[i] !== undefined) ? 'pq mkans' : 'pq mk';
  if (S.answers[i] !== undefined) return 'pq ans';
  if (S.visited[i]) return 'pq vis';
  return 'pq nv';
}
function renderPalette() {
  const b = document.getElementById('dotBox'); b.innerHTML = '';
  S.qs.forEach((q,i) => {
    const d = document.createElement('button');
    d.className = paletteClass(i) + (i === S.idx ? ' cur' : '');
    d.textContent = i+1;
    d.onclick = () => {
      if (S.mode === 'exam' && S.pending !== undefined) {
        if (!confirm('Is question ka jawab abhi SAVE nahi hua (Save & Next nahi dabaya). Phir bhi jaana hai?')) return;
      }
      saveTime(false); S.idx = i; S.pending = undefined; renderQ();
    };
    b.appendChild(d);
  });
  let ans=0, mk=0, ma=0, vis=0;
  S.qs.forEach((q,i) => {
    if (S.answers[i] !== undefined) ans++;
    if (S.marks[i]) { if (S.answers[i] !== undefined) ma++; else mk++; }
    if (S.visited[i]) vis++;
  });
  const notAns = Math.max(0, vis - ans);
  const notVis = S.qs.length - vis;
  document.getElementById('sumAns').textContent = ans;
  document.getElementById('sumNotAns').textContent = notAns;
  document.getElementById('sumMk').textContent = mk;
  document.getElementById('sumMa').textContent = ma;
  document.getElementById('sumNv').textContent = notVis;
  document.getElementById('topAns').textContent = 'Answered: ' + ans + ' / ' + S.qs.length;
}

/* ---------- question render ---------- */
function saveTime() {
  const now = Date.now();
  if (S.enter) S.spent[S.idx] += (now - S.enter)/1000;
  S.enter = now;
}
function renderQ() {
  const q = S.qs[S.idx];
  S.visited[S.idx] = true;
  S.enter = Date.now();
  document.getElementById('qNoLine').innerHTML = '<span class="qno">Question ' + (S.idx+1) + ' of ' + S.qs.length + '</span>';
  document.getElementById('srcLine').innerHTML = 'Source: ' + esc(q.src);
  const showEN = (S.lang === 'en' || S.lang === 'both');
  const showHI = (S.lang === 'hi' || S.lang === 'both');
  document.getElementById('qText').innerHTML = showEN ? esc(q.q[0]) : '';
  document.getElementById('qHi').style.display = (showHI && q.q[1]) ? '' : 'none';
  document.getElementById('qHi').textContent = q.q[1] || '';
  const box = document.getElementById('optBox'); box.innerHTML = '';
  const curSel = (S.pending !== undefined) ? S.pending : S.answers[S.idx];
  q.opts.forEach((o,i) => {
    const lab = document.createElement('label');
    lab.className = 'optrow' + (curSel === i ? ' sel' : '');
    const hin = (o[1] && o[1].toLowerCase() !== o[0].toLowerCase()) ?
      (showHI ? ' <span class="oh">/ ' + esc(o[1]) + '</span>' : '') : '';
    const txt = showEN ? esc(o[0]) + hin : (o[1] ? esc(o[1]) : esc(o[0]));
    lab.innerHTML = '<input type="radio" name="qopt"' + (curSel === i ? ' checked' : '') + '>' +
      '<span class="oidx">(' + L[i] + ')</span><span class="otext">' + txt + '</span>';
    lab.onclick = () => onPick(i);
    box.appendChild(lab);
  });
  document.getElementById('fbBox').innerHTML = '';
  renderPalette();
  /* quiz mode: revisited answered question must still show its feedback */
  if (S.mode === 'quiz' && S.answers[S.idx] !== undefined) showFeedback(S.answers[S.idx]);
}
function onPick(i) {
  if (S.mode === 'exam') {
    S.pending = i;
    renderQ();
  } else {
    if (S.answers[S.idx] !== undefined) return;
    S.answers[S.idx] = i;
    showFeedback(i);
    renderPalette();
  }
}

/* ---------- exam actions (TCS iON behaviour) ---------- */
function clearResp() { S.pending = undefined; delete S.answers[S.idx]; renderQ(); }
function markNext() {
  if (S.pending !== undefined) S.answers[S.idx] = S.pending;
  S.pending = undefined;
  S.marks[S.idx] = true;
  saveTime();
  nextQ();
}
function saveNext() {
  if (S.pending !== undefined) S.answers[S.idx] = S.pending;
  S.pending = undefined;
  saveTime();
  nextQ();
}
function sectionEndNext() {
  /* sections removed (topic-wise file = one continuous test) */
  return Math.min(S.idx+1, S.qs.length-1);
}
function nextQ() {
  S.idx = sectionEndNext();
  renderQ();
}
function moveQ(d) {
  if (S.mode === 'exam' && S.pending !== undefined) {
    if (!confirm('Is question ka jawab abhi SAVE nahi hua (Save & Next nahi dabaya). Phir bhi jaana hai?')) return;
    S.pending = undefined;
  }
  saveTime(false);
  const n = S.idx + d;
  if (n < 0 || n >= S.qs.length) return;
  S.idx = n; S.pending = undefined;
  renderQ();
}

/* ---------- quiz feedback ---------- */
function showFeedback(picked) {
  const q = S.qs[S.idx];
  const ok = picked === q.ans;
  document.querySelectorAll('#optBox .optrow').forEach((el,k) => {
    if (k === q.ans) el.classList.add('correct');
    else if (k === picked) el.classList.add('wrong');
    else el.classList.add('dim');
  });
  document.getElementById('fbBox').innerHTML =
    '<div class="fb ' + (ok ? 'ok' : 'no') + '">' +
    (ok ? '<b>Sahi uttar.</b>' : '<b>Galat uttar.</b> Sahi uttar: <b>(' + L[q.ans] + ') ' + esc(q.opts[q.ans][0]) + '</b>') +
    '<div class="exp"><b>Explanation:</b> ' + esc(q.exp[0] || '') + (q.exp[1] ? '<div class="hi">' + esc(q.exp[1]) + '</div>' : '') + '</div>' +
    '<div class="src">Source (exam/year): ' + esc(q.src) + '</div></div>';
  const cb = document.getElementById('quizNav');
  cb.innerHTML = '';
  const b = document.createElement('button'); b.className = 'abtn next';
  b.innerHTML = S.idx < S.qs.length-1 ? 'Agla Question  »' : 'Result Dekhein  »';
  b.onclick = () => { saveTime(false); if (S.idx < S.qs.length-1) { S.idx++; renderQ(); } else submitTest(false); };
  cb.appendChild(b);
}

/* ---------- submit + analysis ---------- */
function submitTest(auto) {
  saveTime(false);
  if (S.pending !== undefined) S.answers[S.idx] = S.pending;
  const a = Object.keys(S.answers).length;
  const un = S.qs.length - a;
  if (!auto && un > 0 && !confirm(un + ' questions ka uttar save nahi hua hai (ye SKIPPED gine jayenge, galat nahi). Submit karein?')) return;
  if (!auto && un === 0 && !confirm('Saare questions answered hain. Submit karein?')) return;
  clearInterval(S.tick);
  const secs = Math.floor((Date.now()-S.t0)/1000);
  let correct = 0, wrong = 0;
  S.qs.forEach((q,i) => {
    if (S.answers[i] === undefined) return;
    if (S.answers[i] === q.ans) correct++; else wrong++;
  });
  const skipped = S.qs.length - correct - wrong;
  const attempted = correct + wrong;
  const acc = attempted ? Math.round(correct*100/attempted) : 0;
  const net = (correct * (S.marking ? S.marking.pos : 1) - wrong * (S.marking ? S.marking.neg : 0));
  const netStr = (Math.round(net*100)/100).toFixed(2);
  const mkStr = S.marking ? ('+' + S.marking.pos + ' / −' + S.marking.neg) : '+1 / −0';
  const avgT = attempted ? (secs/attempted).toFixed(1) : '—';
  let slow = 0;
  S.spent.forEach((t,i) => { if (t > S.spent[slow]) slow = i; });
  document.getElementById('examRoot').style.display = 'none';
  document.getElementById('resultCard').style.display = '';
  document.getElementById('resTitle').textContent = S.name + ' — ' + (S.mode==='quiz'?'Quiz Mode':'Exam Mode') + ' Result';
  document.getElementById('resSub').innerHTML = 'Topic 7: Network Security • Questions: ' + S.qs.length + ' • Unattempted questions ko SKIPPED mana gaya hai (galat nahi).';
  document.getElementById('statGrid').innerHTML =
    '<div class="stat t"><div class="v">' + netStr + '</div><div class="l">NET MOCK SCORE (' + mkStr + ')</div></div>' +
    '<div class="stat t"><div class="v">' + correct + ' / ' + S.qs.length + '</div><div class="l">SCORE (sahhi count)</div></div>' +
    '<div class="stat c"><div class="v">' + correct + '</div><div class="l">SAHI (CORRECT)</div></div>' +
    '<div class="stat w"><div class="v">' + wrong + '</div><div class="l">GALAT (WRONG)</div></div>' +
    '<div class="stat s"><div class="v">' + skipped + '</div><div class="l">CHHODE HUE (SKIPPED)</div></div>' +
    '<div class="stat t"><div class="v">' + acc + '%</div><div class="l">ACCURACY (attempted)</div></div>' +
    '<div class="stat t"><div class="v">' + fmt(secs) + '</div><div class="l">SAMAY (TIME)</div></div>' +
    '<div class="stat t"><div class="v">' + avgT + 's</div><div class="l">AVG TIME / QUESTION</div></div>' +
    '<div class="stat t"><div class="v">' + (attempted ? (slow+1) : '—') + '</div><div class="l">SABSE ZYADA SAMAY (Q.no)</div></div>';
  let marked = 0; for (const k in S.marks) if (S.marks[k]) marked++;
  document.getElementById('resTable').innerHTML =
    '<tr><th>Candidate</th><td>' + esc(S.name) + '</td><th>Mode</th><td>' + (S.mode==='quiz'?'Quiz':'Exam') + '</td></tr>' +
    '<tr><th>Total Questions</th><td>' + S.qs.length + '</td><th>Attempted</th><td>' + attempted + '</td></tr>' +
    '<tr><th>Correct / Wrong</th><td>' + correct + ' / ' + wrong + '</td><th>Skipped (chhode hue)</th><td>' + skipped + '</td></tr>' +
    '<tr><th>Accuracy</th><td>' + acc + '% (attempted par)</td><th>Marked for review</th><td>' + marked + '</td></tr>' +
    '<tr><th>Net mock score</th><td>' + netStr + ' (' + mkStr + ', mock rule)</td><th>Time taken</th><td>' + fmt(secs) + ' | avg ' + avgT + 's/Q</td></tr>';
  const rb = document.getElementById('revBox'); rb.innerHTML = '';
  S.qs.forEach((q,i) => {
    const picked = S.answers[i];
    let chip, line;
    if (picked === undefined) {
      chip = '<span class="st s">CHHODA (SKIPPED)</span>';
      line = '<div class="line">Is question ka uttar save nahi hua.</div>';
    } else if (picked === q.ans) {
      chip = '<span class="st c">SAHI</span>';
      line = '<div class="line"><span class="okc">Aapka uttar: (' + L[picked] + ') ' + esc(q.opts[picked][0]) + '</span></div>';
    } else {
      chip = '<span class="st w">GALAT</span>';
      line = '<div class="line"><span class="noc">Aapka uttar: (' + L[picked] + ') ' + esc(q.opts[picked][0]) + '</span></div>' +
             '<div class="line"><span class="okc">Sahi uttar: (' + L[q.ans] + ') ' + esc(q.opts[q.ans][0]) + '</span></div>';
    }
    const div = document.createElement('div');
    div.className = 'rev';
    div.innerHTML = chip + (S.marks[i] ? '<span class="st" style="background:#c6aeee;color:#2f1a5e;border:1px solid #8a63c9">MARKED</span>' : '') +
      '<div class="qh">Q' + (i+1) + '. ' + esc(q.q[0]) + '</div>' +
      '<div class="qhm">' + esc(q.q[1] || '') + '</div>' +
      q.opts.map((o,k) => '<div class="line">' + (k === q.ans ? '<span class="okc">(' + L[k] + ') ' + esc(o[0]) + '</span>' : '(' + L[k] + ') ' + esc(o[0])) + '</div>').join('') +
      line +
      '<div class="exp"><b>Explanation:</b> ' + esc(q.exp[0] || '—') + (q.exp[1] ? '<div class="hi">' + esc(q.exp[1]) + '</div>' : '') + '</div>' +
      '<div class="meta">Samay: ' + (S.spent[i] || 0).toFixed(0) + ' second &nbsp;|&nbsp; Source (exam/year): ' + esc(q.src) + '</div>';
    rb.appendChild(div);
  });
  window.scrollTo({top:0,behavior:'smooth'});
}
document.getElementById('nameIn').addEventListener('keyup', e => { if (e.key === 'Enter') startTest(); });
</script>
</body>
</html>
